{"updated":1795446441641,"festivals":[{"id":"tiqff-2025","name":"臺灣國際酷兒影展","start":"2025-10-03","end":"2025-10-12","site":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","source":"臺灣國際酷兒影展官網","films":[{"id":"27","title":"27","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","intro":"27歲的艾莉絲仍住在父母家裡，夢境與幻想是她的出口，但缺乏私人空間與親密關係卻讓她停在生命的十字路口。某天一場迷幻派對後，她因為喝了太多，騎單車時發生嚴重意外，而這場意外卻成為她轉大人的可能？導演以鮮豔的畫風、節奏強烈的音樂與超現實幻想場景不斷交錯，讓逃避現實的艾莉絲回到現實，舞動身體，面對自己。","poster":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/morgan91204/scriptable-movie-schedule/img/fest/tiqff-2025/1fd176358ba628dd.jpg","posterFrom":"https://tiqff.org.tw/admin/ImageHandler.ashx?ImId=1805&t=filelist&c=fileimage"},{"id":"酷兒探戈","title":"酷兒探戈","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nZyL5NfwUNRUDUHCM8u1y3s18bZ.jpg"},{"id":"跨記憶","title":"跨記憶","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/iadWDgJ0ytNiW4MkvXapHATNbZr.jpg"},{"id":"上半身","title":"上半身","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/wI5eUJpR9nns1zwdQC5AF88kjJy.jpg"},{"id":"壹凡村的蔓玉","title":"壹凡村的蔓玉","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/wTqQHgmwjwZKW1u5X8AqAY1e6bI.jpg"},{"id":"愛作歹","title":"愛作歹","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/xV0WR87rEdAANm5APzVVv35Ja2t.jpg"},{"id":"夢蝶之吻","title":"夢蝶之吻","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nJP67tALNzVlQseC3rE6fh5NsHy.jpg"},{"id":"哈維與左恩斯：甜度減半","title":"哈維與左恩斯：甜度減半","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/7q7nKNhRARu8UHrszwFAmkrrKLl.jpg"},{"id":"愛上GRETA","title":"愛上GRETA","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","intro":"由毛氈木偶定格動畫所組成的可愛酷兒愛情故事。當愛情來敲門，Greta的世界起了漣漪，壞掉的水龍頭、溢出的水不再是麻煩事，反而成了無法平息的波瀾；當愛降臨時，心跳噗通、熱情如滾沸的水，無法平衡的愛情，讓Greta 的世界顛倒了，她任性如壞掉的水龍頭，然而持續湧動的水，卻也是讓愛相逢的希望。","poster":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/morgan91204/scriptable-movie-schedule/img/fest/tiqff-2025/063e97a9c4437b14.jpg","posterFrom":"https://tiqff.org.tw/admin/ImageHandler.ashx?ImId=2009&t=filelist&c=fileimage"},{"id":"航行的克里斯多福","title":"航行的克里斯多福","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574"},{"id":"素描","title":"素描","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nXUvv4UeNfNhrA8bd9wFfClrroN.jpg"},{"id":"Mamántula","title":"Mamántula","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","intro":"導演結合了肉體恐怖、酷兒文化（男同志慾望場域）與類型片三者，將主角描繪成一個眾多男人渴望的「人」，由於它對血液與精液難以滿足的慾望，引發了連環殺人案件。影片巧妙地游走於黑色電影的偵探環節、科幻電影中外星異種結合，及酷兒影像的肉體情色慾望之間，混搭的同時也表現了酷兒社群對肉體與空間的矛盾與尷尬，酷兒影像的觀看是否過於秩序？在其它品種介入的同時，傳統「酷兒觀看」中對肉體與慾望的想像，是否也面臨失序而產生新的可能。","poster":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/morgan91204/scriptable-movie-schedule/img/fest/tiqff-2025/d9fd9cd77832db10.jpg","posterFrom":"https://tiqff.org.tw/admin/ImageHandler.ashx?ImId=2014&t=filelist&c=fileimage"},{"id":"Pooja大人","title":"Pooja大人","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","intro":"兩名男童在尼泊爾南部村莊失踪，來自加德滿都的警察 Pooja 被派來偵辦此案。影片以犯罪懸疑類型為主基調，導演透過偵查過程，展現主角同志身份於警界的矛盾，以及如何面對性別偏見與地方政治角力，同時也映照出尼泊爾社會的真實樣貌。最終迫使觀眾直面與省思種族、種姓和歸屬感等不安的真相。","poster":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/morgan91204/scriptable-movie-schedule/img/fest/tiqff-2025/237e9fd83955d06e.jpg","posterFrom":"https://tiqff.org.tw/admin/ImageHandler.ashx?ImId=1972&t=filelist&c=fileimage"},{"id":"小天使","title":"小天使","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/7Ms3FUo2ERbjz4X51nAsrb8tQUw.jpg"},{"id":"夏妹的相機","title":"夏妹的相機","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/pIunkj2nB9nuJDfBVi0pt3koO4n.jpg"},{"id":"侯蜜和蘿禾之家具裡面男人的秘密","title":"侯蜜和蘿禾之家具裡面男人的秘密","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","intro":"Romy 與 Laure 與她們的社群生活平靜又迷幻，充斥著派對互動與情人探索等日常，女性成為主體，其身體行為與角色之間看似不停切換的流動風格，象徵性別與身份的非固定，某天出現了一個男人&hellip;&hellip;本片將男性從主體降格為物件，顛覆了傳統影像裡「女性身體被觀看」的慾望與權力關係。 Using over a hundred analog images, the video depicts Romy and Laure's lively and intimate lives, delving into themes of sexuality, friendship, and queer identity with comedy and candor. The film's burlesque and whimsical approach questions traditional notions about se…","poster":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/morgan91204/scriptable-movie-schedule/img/fest/tiqff-2025/03b6fc59c212bc5a.jpg","posterFrom":"https://tiqff.org.tw/admin/ImageHandler.ashx?ImId=1951&t=filelist&c=fileimage"},{"id":"侯蜜和蘿禾之魔法插座","title":"侯蜜和蘿禾之魔法插座","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","intro":"Romy 與 Laure 與室友 &Eacute;lisa 及貓咪 Titi 同住，突然出現的「肛塞」並帶著亮晶晶的耀眼效果，一種難以抵抗的魔力、一種非男身體或非女裸體的魔法之物。以女性為主體的遊戲方式，開啟其對情色具像化、性玩具去汙名化，甚至反諷地將禁忌挑戰賦予神聖光環。","poster":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/morgan91204/scriptable-movie-schedule/img/fest/tiqff-2025/d7d302f906cff940.jpg","posterFrom":"https://tiqff.org.tw/admin/ImageHandler.ashx?ImId=1956&t=filelist&c=fileimage"},{"id":"小拳頭","title":"小拳頭","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/m2yGutTfqhgKscmm2kEClBL92DT.jpg"},{"id":"當我還繼續呼吸","title":"當我還繼續呼吸","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/njAbOKXeAFecJi07gRr3PM3UZQ0.jpg"},{"id":"沒有人在看我們","title":"沒有人在看我們","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574"},{"id":"性不算什麼","title":"性不算什麼","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574"},{"id":"流動性","title":"流動性","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/bfkvHOHjVxJYLhuVz3D1By36FW2.jpg"},{"id":"三溫暖日","title":"三溫暖日","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/6GGkLni6Z0M6Xb8ZEkWd5Jb8b1e.jpg"},{"id":"安吉拉","title":"安吉拉","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/1cSMsHvbvC2OZ9ryhhsW6WDC0QP.jpg"},{"id":"聖巴斯提安德拉吉：白金級性愛","title":"聖巴斯提安德拉吉：白金級性愛","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/zPNkQfioJ6ZeedpKSryCVA9IxWq.jpg"},{"id":"聖巴斯提安德拉吉：卡拉OK他命","title":"聖巴斯提安德拉吉：卡拉OK他命","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574"},{"id":"聖巴斯提安德拉吉：戴爾·庫柏","title":"聖巴斯提安德拉吉：戴爾·庫柏","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574"},{"id":"尋愛","title":"尋愛","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/kcqiBDtFFNGAkAEEMod6J770NeR.jpg"},{"id":"深喉嚨","title":"深喉嚨","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574"},{"id":"菊花","title":"菊花","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hZHB2k3ViTxjeApf03h9ycS1H0v.jpg"},{"id":"反射","title":"反射","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/dL8w3CfIC8Yqk7JKc7p1pkJhpBH.jpg"},{"id":"極樂夜公園","title":"極樂夜公園","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nxVA8776thmoAdh2n47wpXMgSIQ.jpg"},{"id":"薔薇的葬禮","title":"薔薇的葬禮","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/5hxdRupM919r4LpevX2etgQ0OrQ.jpg"},{"id":"逐愛絮語","title":"逐愛絮語","mins":0,"rating":"","url":"https://tiqff.org.tw/Festival.aspx?ID=1574","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/qqCjyKA6TB0lPdUeEEHDwY9tkZL.jpg"},{"id":"最好的龜蜜","title":"最好的龜